---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About WhereTo30A" description="A local family guide to 30A and Florida's Emerald Coast.">
  <div class="container section article">
    <h1>About WhereTo30A</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      WhereTo30A sits between Google and Facebook: a structured directory with the soul of a local community.
    </p>
    <p>
      We are a local family who lives on 30A. Kelley and Brett built the guide we always wanted: town-scoped
      discovery, honest business listings, timely updates from the businesses themselves, and a place to ask
      locals anything.
    </p>
    <p>No ratings, no stars, no noise. Just the best of 30A, curated by people who are here every day.</p>
    <p>Contact: hello@whereto30a.com / feedback@whereto30a.com</p>
    <p class="credit">Photography by Coast Love Collection.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .article {
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .lede {
    font-size: var(--font-size-3);
    color: var(--brand-ink-soft);
  }
  .credit {
    font-size: var(--font-size-1);
    color: var(--brand-ink-soft);
    font-style: italic;
  }
</style>
